  "remarks": "TAi.027 Title: a) Mullah b) Maulavi Designation: Deputy Minister of Education under the Taliban Regime (1996-2001). Taliban member responsible for Jawzjan province, Northern Afghanistan until 2008. Involved in drug trafficking.  Heigh 178cm. Passport no: a) Afghanistan diplomatic passport D00009723 b) Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0010098, issued on 4 Apr. 2023, issued in Kabul, Afghanistan, expires 4 Apr. 2028. (Name in Latin script, Abdul Salam Hanafi, name in original script; عبدالسلام حنفي). c) P03078281, issued on 9 Feb. 2020, issued in Dubai, expires 9 Feb. 2030.; Listing: Listed on 23 February 2001 (amended on 3 Sep 2003, 18 Jul. 2007, 21 Sep 2007. 27 Sep. 2007 and 1 Feb 2008, 29 Nov 2011, 10 Mar. 2026, 28 Apr. 2026,  27 Aug. 2026)",
